4M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a> entirely in an app, in partnership with Apple. Those initiatives included Visible, the first all-digital, direct-to-consumer carrier in the US.</p><p class="cm-intro-studio">Evenings and weekends, I run <span class="cm-link-unit"><a class="cm-inline-link" href="https://renderedintent.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="cm-new-tab-note" title="Opens in a new tab"><span class="cm-intro-link-text">Rendered </span><span class="cm-intro-link-end"><span class="cm-intro-link-text">Intent</span><svg class="cm-intro-link-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 12 12 4M4 4h8v8"/></svg></span></a>,</span> a small studio where I work out how AI changes the way products get designed and built.</p><div class="cm-intro-stack"><p class="cm-stack-label">Currently building with</p><p class="cm-stack-row"><span class="cm-stack-item">React</span> <span class="cm-stack-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span class="cm-stack-item">Astro</span> <span class="cm-stack-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span class="cm-stack-item">TypeScript</span> <span class="cm-stack-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span class="cm-stack-item">SwiftUI</span> <span class="cm-stack-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span class="cm-stack-item">AI APIs</span></p><p class="cm-stack-row"><span class="cm-stack-item">Vercel</span> <span class="cm-stack-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span class="cm-stack-item">Supabase</span> <span class="cm-stack-slash" aria-hidden="true">/</span> <span class="cm-stack-item">Fly.io</span></p></div></div><div class="cm-intro-contact"><p><span>Let’s work together.</span> I'm always interested in new projects and opportunities.</p><a href="mailto:hello@chrismackintosh.work">hello@chrismackintosh.work</a></div></div>

